# Wave 13: fix controller (docs.lammps.org/fix_controller.html), a PID loop that
# drives the centre-of-mass velocity (process variable v_vcmx) to a setpoint by
# changing the force of fix addforce (control variable fc, an internal-style
# variable). Nevery 10, alpha 1.0, Kp 0.5, Ki 0.2, Kd 0.1.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all rel=1e-7 abs=1e-9
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
variable        vx atom 1.4*sin(1.7*x+2.3*y+0.7*z)
variable        vy atom 1.4*cos(2.1*x-1.1*y+0.3*z)
variable        vz atom 1.4*sin(0.5*x+1.9*z+1.3*y)
velocity        all set v_vx v_vy v_vz units box
velocity        all zero linear
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix 1 all nve
variable fc internal 0.0
fix push all addforce v_fc 0.0 0.0
variable vcmx equal vcm(all,x)
fix ctl all controller 10 1.0 0.5 0.2 0.1 v_vcmx 0.5 fc
timestep 0.005
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo_style custom step v_vcmx v_fc f_ctl[1] f_ctl[2] f_ctl[3]
thermo 5
run 200
